      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Indicates that the audio may only be captured by system apps. System apps can capture for many purposes like accessibility, live captions, user guidance... but abide to the following restrictions: - the audio cannot leave the device - the audio cannot be passed to a third party app - the audio cannot be recorded at a higher quality than 16kHz 16bit mono See Builder.setAllowedCapturePolicy.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/media/AudioAttributes#ALLOW_CAPTURE_BY_SYSTEM" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.media.AudioAttributes.ALLOW_CAPTURE_BY_SYSTEM</code>.</a></format></para>
